{
  "description": "Chemistry lab organism — a declarative molecule diagram (atoms, bonds, and arrows on a chemistry-canvas), an animated reversible-reaction bond form/break oscillator, and an interactive acid-base titration simulator (pH curve, equivalence point, indicator color), composed from the std-chem-molecule, std-chem-reaction, and std-chem-titration instrument atoms behind a mode router.",
